# @janus-scheduler/nlp — generated data, not source.
#
# artifacts/ is byte-identical to the research repo; reformatting would break
# the `cmp` provenance check. fixtures/*.json are Python-generated golden files
# (parity.json is 1.3 MB minified — reformatting balloons it into tens of MB).
#
# Scoped to the data files only, so fixtures/README.md and any future source
# alongside it are still formatted normally.
packages/nlp/artifacts/
packages/nlp/fixtures/*.json

# ALGORITHM.md is the NORMATIVE frozen spec, copied from the research repo, and
# PROJECT.md is its working log. They are upstream documents, not this repo's
# prose — reformatting them would make future diffs against the research repo
# meaningless. The root `npm run format` script globs `**/*.md`, so without this
# entry a routine format run would silently rewrite the spec.
packages/nlp/docs/
